WEBVTT

00:12:57.601 --> 00:13:00.672
CA: (Laughs) Sorry.

00:13:00.696 --> 00:13:04.026
Now, look, 10 years ago,
you started off this venture firm,

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:07.526
Sinovation, in Beijing,
with strong local support there,

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.137
and have seen this hub,

00:13:09.161 --> 00:13:11.676
the sort of Sand Hill Road --

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.573
Sand Hill Road is the innovation hub
at the heart of Silicon Valley --

00:13:15.597 --> 00:13:18.831
flourishing in really a rapid time
there in Beijing,

00:13:18.855 --> 00:13:21.505
and you are one of the people
right at the heart of it.

00:13:21.529 --> 00:13:24.625
What have you seen recently
that has taken your breath away

00:13:24.649 --> 00:13:26.605
in terms of a new trend

00:13:26.629 --> 00:13:31.299
or a new type of AI-powered innovation
that's happening right there?